dy does not deliver.","cohort":["E3","E5","G5","T5b","T6","T9","necessity","project.failure-disposition-contract","project.portability"],"criteria":["E3"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.8368,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Title: 'batch enrichment quartet + digest into one write lane (cut ~14K commits/day at source)'","Scope: 'TICKET_DIGEST + DONE_ENRICH collapse from two commits to one commit ... CLAIM_ENRICH remains its own committed and auto-pushed event'","AC5: 'drop from CLAIM + DIGEST + DONE (3 commits) to CLAIM + batched-finalize (2 commits)'","Implementation plan header: '(2026-09-01, narrowed by operator decision)'"],"finding":"The title promises batching an enrichment 'quartet + digest into one write lane', but the narrowed body collapses only the two finalize events (TICKET_DIGEST + DONE_ENRICH) into one commit while CLAIM_ENRICH stays a separate committed event — a 3->2 commit reduction, not a quartet-into-one-lane. The headline overstates the delivered scope.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fbefc53280cd5dbaf","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Title / Scope / AC5","norm_id":"n55523d80c4a18e1d","priority":0.1132,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Retitle to reflect the narrowed decision, e.g. 'W1: batch the post-enrich finalize pair (TICKET_DIGEST + DONE_ENRICH) into one commit'.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiab